{%- comment -%}
  Heart button for a product card, so a shopper can save from a collection
  grid without opening the product.

  Markup only — the styling and the click handling live in
  snippets/carbon-wishlist-global.liquid, which is rendered once per page. A
  collection grid can hold fifty of these, and repeating a <style> and a
  <script> fifty times would bloat the HTML for no benefit.

  It saves the card's first available variant, which is the same variant the
  product page opens on, so saving from the grid and saving from the product
  page produce the same entry rather than two.

  Usage:  {%- render 'carbon-wishlist-card-button', product: product_card_product -%}
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign cw_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}
{%- if cw_variant -%}
  <button
    type="button"
    class="cw-card-heart"
    aria-label="Add to wishlist"
    aria-pressed="false"
    data-cw-card
    data-variant-id="{{ cw_variant.id }}"
    data-product-id="{{ product.id }}"
    data-handle="{{ product.handle }}"
  >
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M12 21.35l-1.45-1.32C5.4 15.36 2 12.28 2 8.5 2 5.42 4.42 3 7.5 3c1.74 0 3.41.81 4.5 2.09C13.09 3.81 14.76 3 16.5 3 19.58 3 22 5.42 22 8.5c0 3.78-3.4 6.86-8.55 11.54L12 21.35z"/>
    </svg>
  </button>
{%- endif -%}
